{"id":"ced9b6a78e4e3137","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-separation-closed-class.md","title":"ZFC Separation Closed Class","display":"df-zfc-separation-closed-class — ZFC Separation Closed Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-separation-closed-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-separation-closed-class"],"display":"df-zfc-separation-closed-class — ZFC Separation Closed Class","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-class]]","[[58-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-separation-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-separation-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-separation-closed-class — ZFC Separation Closed Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> (class parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,\\varphi,\\vec a\\in V\">\\(x,\\varphi,\\vec a\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> (definable-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\varphi[y,\\vec a]\">\\((C,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\varphi[y,\\vec a]\\)</span> (class-satisfaction schema in the ambient two-sorted class metatheory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeparationClosedClass}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeparationClosedClass}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (class-schema predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}separation\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{SeparationClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in C^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\\{y\\in x\\mid(C,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\varphi[y,\\vec a]\\}\\in C\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}separation\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{SeparationClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in C^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\\{y\\in x\\mid(C,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\varphi[y,\\vec a]\\}\\in C\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Separation closure requires every subset of a member <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> definable over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,\\in)\">\\((C,\\in)\\)</span> with finitely many parameters from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> to belong to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Satisfaction for a possibly proper class is explicitly schematic in the ambient two-sorted class metatheory; the set-coded satisfaction predicate is not applied outside its domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S$ (definable-class predicate, see [[58-df-class]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"x,\\varphi,\\vec a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"(C,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\varphi[y,\\vec a]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SeparationClosedClass}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}separation\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{SeparationClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in C^{<\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\\{y\\in x\\mid(C,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\varphi[y,\\vec a]\\}\\in C\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"(C,\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false}],"bytes":1444,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3339","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-separation-closed-class.md|58-df-zfc-separation-closed-class]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca2a9c9166fa8cce","65418b505fc53093"]}